  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Aniline reacts with mixed acid (conc. <math><mi>H</mi><mi>N</mi><msub><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> and conc. <math><msub><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi>S</mi><msub><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> ) at <math><mn>288</mn><mi> </mi><mi>K</mi><mi> </mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi> </mi><mi>P</mi><mi> </mi><mo>(</mo><mn>51</mn><mi> </mi><mi>%</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>Q</mi><mi> </mi><mo>(</mo><mn>47</mn><mi>%</mi><mo>)</mo><mi> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi> </mi><mi>R</mi><mi> </mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>%</mi><mo>)</mo></math> . The major product(s) of the following reaction sequence is (are)<br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/fvfdworziiwroxsbzshnbflwobngxhtwargqmyiksjyzjldsig.jpeg\"/></p>",
